  "keyFeatures": [
    "169 ns synchronous checkSync API — allocation-free, zero-await hot path",
    "GALE: TLA⁺-verified fleet-size-independent overshoot bound for distributed leasing",
    "TALE: LLM token-budget escrow with provably bounded post-hoc cost metering",
    "Eight rate-limiting algorithms: GCRA, token bucket, fixed/sliding window, leaky bucket, quota, adaptive concurrency",
    "Six storage backends (in-memory, Redis, Postgres, DynamoDB, Deno KV, Cloudflare) proven bit-identical via conformance vectors",
    "13 framework/transport adapters: Express, Fastify, Koa, Hono, Next.js, NestJS, SvelteKit, Remix, Elysia, fetch, Lambda, tRPC, gRPC",
    "Multi-dimensional limiting — compose per-IP ∧ per-user ∧ per-route in one round trip",
    "Unified rate × concurrency × cost admission with optional joint-LP bid-price filter",
    "Fixed-memory DDoS sketch (Count-Min Sketch, ~7.4 KB) for unbounded key universes",
    "Policy Plans: replay recorded traffic against a candidate policy to preview allow↔deny changes before deploy",
    "Zero runtime dependencies — 24 tree-shakeable subpath entry points",
    "ThrottleKit Lens: zero-dependency terminal monitoring dashboard with live binding-axis attribution"
  ],
